{"id":"e56495c9794b9dd7","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-universal-cone.md","title":"Universal Cone","display":"df-universal-cone — Universal Cone","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-universal-cone","aliases":["58-df-universal-cone","Universal Cone"],"display":"df-universal-cone — Universal Cone","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-universal-cone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-universal-cone</span><span>Universal Cone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-cone — Universal Cone"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi,X,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi,X,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span> (category data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J,F_0,F_1\\in V\">\\(C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J,F_0,F_1\\in V\\)</span> (显式范畴与函子分量)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}_S\\)</span> (functor predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cone}_S,\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Cone}_S,\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cone\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J,C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,F_0,F_1\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;J=\\langle J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,J,\\mathcal C)\n\\land L\\in C_0\\land\\pi\\in C_1^{J_0}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j\\in J_0\\;\\bigl(s_C(\\pi(j))=L\\land t_C(\\pi(j))=F_0(j)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in J_1\\;\\left(\nc_C\\!\\left(\\left\\langle F_1(a),\\pi(s_J(a))\\right\\rangle\\right)\n=\\pi(t_J(a))\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cone\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Cone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J,C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,F_0,F_1\\;\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;J=\\langle J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(J)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\n\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,J,\\mathcal C)\n\\land L\\in C_0\\land\\pi\\in C_1^{J_0}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall j\\in J_0\\;\\bigl(s_C(\\pi(j))=L\\land t_C(\\pi(j))=F_0(j)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in J_1\\;\\left(\nc_C\\!\\left(\\left\\langle F_1(a),\\pi(s_J(a))\\right\\rangle\\right)\n=\\pi(t_J(a))\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cone\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J\\;\\left(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\land J=\\langle J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall\\alpha\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,X,\\alpha)\\to\n\\exists!u\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\ns_C(u)=X\\land t_C(u)=L\n\\land\\forall j\\in J_0\\;\\bigl(\nc_C(\\langle\\pi(j),u\\rangle)=\\alpha(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cone\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C,J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J\\;\\left(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s_C,t_C,c_C,e_C\\rangle\\land J=\\langle J_0,J_1,s_J,t_J,c_J,e_J\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Cone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\\land\n\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall\\alpha\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Cone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,X,\\alpha)\\to\n\\exists!u\\in C_1\\;\\Bigl(\ns_C(u)=X\\land t_C(u)=L\n\\land\\forall j\\in J_0\\;\\bigl(\nc_C(\\langle\\pi(j),u\\rangle)=\\alpha(j)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cone\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniversalCone}(L,\\pi;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\;\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}universal\\text{-}cone\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniversalCone}(L,\\pi;F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal C,J\\;\\mathrm{UniversalCone}_S(\\mathcal C,J,F,L,\\pi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Universal cone: the limiting cone for a diagram; encodes universal property of limit</li>\n<li>对象、箭头、源靶、复合以及函子的对象/箭头映射均从集合编码中显式解包；不存在无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(a)\">\\(F(a)\\)</span> 或下标族投影。</li>\n<li>Limit cone: family of morphisms <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\pi_j: L \\to F(j)\\}\">\\(\\{\\pi_j: L \\to F(j)\\}\\)</span> such that triangles commute</li>\n<li>若各类图的极限组成函子，则对角函子满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\dashv\\varprojlim\">\\(\\Delta\\dashv\\varprojlim\\)</span>；原文件把伴随方向写反。</li>\n<li>Category of cones: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{C} \\downarrow F\">\\(\\mathcal{C} \\downarrow F\\)</span>; limit is terminal in this category</li>\n<li>Colimit case: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta \\dashv \\varinjlim\">\\(\\Delta \\dashv \\varinjlim\\)</span>, initial cone, cocone category</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Riehl, Category Theory in Context</li>\n<li>Borceux, Handbook of Categorical Algebra</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"targe